I mentioned on IRC a while back that I was, as a performance-addicted
Googler, dismayed by the sluggishness of jbovlaste. I might take that
on as a Lojban hackathon project. I understand Robin has ideas (and
possibly code?) for a new version, and I haven't moved forward on it
yet.

Whether I work on that or something else, I think a Lojban hackathon
would be good fun.

